M1.T - The Sandwich One

Assumptions
-- I have a knife, Peanut butter jar and bread x 2 sitting on counter in front of robot.

Step One
- 1. Pick up peanut butter jar.
- 2. Open peanut butter jar.
- 3. set peanut butter jar down.
- 4. Set lid down.

Step Two
- 1. Pick up knife and scoop peanut butter from jar on to knife.
- 2. Spread peanut butter on to bread slice 1.
- 3. Repeat task 1 and 2 until peanut butter covers bread slice 1 entirely.

Step Three
- 1. Set Knife down.
- 2. Pick up bread slice 2
- 3. Move bread slice 2 over bread slice 1
- 4. Set bread slice 2 down gently on bread slice 1

Step Four
- 1. Pick up peanut butter lid
- 2. Place lid on top of peanut butter jar
- 3. twist lid 3 times.
- 4. raise arm and wave once
- 5. Done after wave
